### 1. Get flags for UBa (PUBLIC — no auth, header tells which uni)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/settings/flags
X-University-Id: {{ubaId}}

### 2. Get flags for UB (PUBLIC)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/settings/flags
X-University-Id: {{ubId}}

### 3. Get flags via query param (PUBLIC fallback)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/settings/flags?universityId={{ubaId}}

### 4. Get flags with NO header/query — should default to UBa via env
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/settings/flags

### 5. Announcement (PUBLIC) — expect null initially
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/settings/announcement
X-University-Id: {{ubaId}}

### 6. Enable student_view for UBa (SUPER ADMIN)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/settings/enable_student_view
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isEnabled": true
}

### 7. Verify — flags endpoint now shows student_view true
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/settings/flags
X-University-Id: {{ubaId}}

### 8. Set announcement for UBa (SUPER ADMIN)
